{"id": 10092895, "reference": "SR/00300/25", "publication_date": "2025-01-21T09:51:04.694Z", "modification_date": "2025-01-21T09:51:04.696Z", "country": "Sweden", "product_category": "GADGETS", "product_name": "Ear muff", "product_name_specific": "Bluetooth Warm Ear Muff", "risk_description": "The solders in the product have an excessive concentration of lead (measured value up to 76% by weight). The plastic in the product has an excessive concentration of DBP and DEHP (measured value up to 0.5 and 1% by weight respectively). Furthermore, the plastic in the product has an excessive concentration of short-chain chlorinated paraffins (SCCPs) (measured value up to 1.51% by weight).\nLead poses a risk to the environment. DBP and DEHP pose a risk to the environment and human life. SCCPs persist in the environment, are toxic to aquatic organisms at low concentrations and bio-accumulate in wildlife and humans, posing a risk to human health and the environment. Prolonged exposure to them through the skin may cause cancer.\n\n", "legal_provision": "The product does not comply with the requirements of the Directive on the restriction of the use of certain hazardous substances in electrical and electronic equipment (RoHS 2 Directive) nor with the Persistent Organic Pollutants (POP) Regulation.", "country_of_origin": "Unknown", "sold_online": "UNKNOWN", "notification_type": "ARTICLE_12", "brands": ["Midy"], "model_types": ["688"], "risk_types": ["ENVIRONMENT"], "measures": ["PRODUCT_WITHDRAWAL_FROM_MARKET"], "embedding_model": "siglip2-b16-256", "embedding_dim": 768, "photos": [{"photo_id": 10944761, "main": true, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10944762, "main": false, "embedding": ""}]}